    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0639" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.5151/999: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-09-26T11:00:00+01:00">September 26,
                            1936—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 26—9:51 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>926. From Cochran. At about 1 o’clock this morning the Minister of Finance of
                    France gave to the press the French text of the declaration on monetary policy
                    which was being made simultaneously with the American and British corresponding
                    declarations.…</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>[Cochran]</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
